{"author":"Rebar Bot Nava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"body":"Implementation note after plan review: the renamed real-guard test was listed by node id in .github/windows-sweep-deselect/unclassified.args, so that entry is replaced by the two tests that succeed it (same Windows status quo); the census comment in tests/unit/test_timeout_budget_headroom.py now says the floor is the fallback probe's bound. The regression test fails loudly if GIT_DIR/GIT_COMMON_DIR/GIT_WORK_TREE are set, since the reader then defers to git by design. Reproduction: before, 6 s rev-parse HEAD shim => '1 error in 15.75s' (TimeoutExpired after 5 seconds); after, same shim => '1 passed in 1.11s'. Guard tests: 35 passed."},"env_id":"492a5c71-6cda-48a6-8134-02ff6a672739","event_type":"COMMENT","timestamp":1795244529221554001,"uuid":"6d4665a2-1b56-498e-8c58-4502a847869d"}